&lt;li&gt;100% remote work for everyone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group medical, dental, and vision coverage insurance (with opt-out benefits)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401K with matching / Pension contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness, Technology &amp;amp; Education Allowances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target base salary is £55K–£60K GBP, with competitive, uncapped commission structure, based on location and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits may vary based on employment status or country location.&lt;/p&gt;
