&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By 3 Months… &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re fully up to speed on Acceleration Partners&#39; value proposition, services, and sales process, and on how the handoff to strategy and account management works. You&#39;ve built an active outbound pipeline, are engaging multiple enterprise prospects, and know when and how to bring in the strategy team.&lt;/p&gt;
